385
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:52,650
Yes,

386
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:54,580
I'm talking about you.

387
00:21:54,580 --> 00:21:56,360
I'm already downstairs at the lab.

388
00:21:56,360 --> 00:21:58,080
Let's go have a nice lunch

389
00:21:58,080 --> 00:22:00,700
and slowly discuss our travel itinerary.

390
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:02,240
[Can't help but smile]

391
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:06,540
This is also a manifestation
of a self-fulfilling prophecy.

392
00:22:06,540 --> 00:22:07,580
For example,

393
00:22:07,580 --> 00:22:08,750
you have a fight with your husband,

394
00:22:08,750 --> 00:22:09,630
and you think to yourself

395
00:22:09,630 --> 00:22:11,580
that he should come
and apologize to you himself.

396
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:13,350
Then you go on a live stream

397
00:22:13,370 --> 00:22:14,690
and keep scolding him

398
00:22:14,710 --> 00:22:15,700
and mocking him.

399
00:22:15,700 --> 00:22:17,870
And he actually gives in and apologizes.

400
00:22:17,870 --> 00:22:19,750
Alright, have a nice lunch, everyone.

401
00:22:19,750 --> 00:22:21,290
I'm going to have lunch with my husband.

402
00:22:21,290 --> 00:22:23,200
I'll just forgive him.

403
00:22:23,340 --> 00:22:24,600
Bye-bye.
